products.sourceDescription:
An essential centrepiece for the Christmas season, which can be used this year and next - go for this HOMCOM artificial Christmas tree. Made from plastic, this is a stable piece which can used many times over; with 1821 tips it is lush and voluptuous - looks so realistic! The bare design means you can dress it up with any decorations and lights as you like - so how you want your Christmas home to look like, is entirely up to you. Xmas tree is complete with a metal base to weigh down.
 Fully artificial design, it is flame retardant for safety. Keep away from direct flames!;
 6ft tall, with 1821 branches: a tall and voluptuous design, looks like a real tree;
 Bare design to dress with your favourite decorations and lights;
 Hinges and easy-to-shape moulded branches for quick and easy setup;
 Metal base keeps the xmas tree weighted to stand steady in place;
 Colour: Green;
 Material: Plastic, Metal;
 Overall Dimension: F117 x 180Hcm;
 Tree Height: 6ft;
 Tip Count: 1821;
 Item Label: 830-886V02GN;
 Note:;
 Only for indoor use, not for outdoor;
 In order to get a full appearance, please spread out all individual tips to get the best possible look from the tree, suggest you to take 15 minutes to shape the tree.

