products.sourceDescription:
Add a little holly-jolly holiday joy to your home or office with this Pre-Lit Decorative Xmas Tree from HOMCOM! It is pre-sprung with 200 clear warm lights that remain lit even if a bulb burns out. Comes decorated with fake ornament ball, this tree is sure to delight throughout the seat and ready to spread Christmas cheer!
 Pine styled tree stands up to 1.8m tall with 1.12m diameter; - Made of dense PVC needles with 745 branches to appear natural and full to last all season; - Pre-lit 200 LED Lights add a festival glow to your home; - Christmas ornaments spread throughout the branches; - Sturdy foldable metal base provides stability to keep your tree standing tall; - Easy to assemble and disassemble for storage; - Perfect for indoor decoration at Christmas, foil the festival atmosphere; - RECOMMENDED SETUP: For the fullest results, work from bottom to top spreading every branch in a spiral motion;
 Item Name: Christmas Tree; - Brand Name: HOMCOM; - Material: PVC, Metal Stand; - Colour: Green; - Net Weight: 7kg; - - Transformer Voltage: 100-240V/50Hz; - Cord Length: 1.8m; - Power: 3.6W; - Input Voltage: 31V; - Branch Tip: 745; - Flat Pack: YES; - Assembly Required: YES; - Custom Label: 830-186

