products.sourceDescription:
Christmas spirit, doubled with this set of two 2ft prelit christmas trees. With snow-brushed tips, red berries and pine cones, the trees are already dressed and can be set up how they arrive; add your own decorations for a personal touch. Each Christmas tree with lights gently illuminates your space, looking beautiful in the dark. Set up is easy too, taking about ten minutes, you just need to shape the branches into place.
 Set of two 2ft LED christmas trees. Use together or individually;
 Battery operated LED lights: 18-hours on, six-hours off timer;
 Snow-brushed branches with red berries and pine cones: a beautiful seasonal look;
 Flame retardant branches enhance safety. Tough plastic to use this year and following seasons;
 Single-section design. Just shape the branches, approx. three minutes needed;
 Colour: Green;
 Light Colour: Warm White;
 Material: Plastic, Concrete, Metal;
 Overall Dimension: F43 x 60Hcm;
 Tree Height: 2ft;
 Tip Count: 141;
 LED Count: 20;
 Cord Length: 0.3(m);
 Item Label: 830-920V02GN;
 Note:;
 Only for indoor use, not for outdoor;
 In order to get a full appearance, please spread out all individual tips to get optimal look from the tree, suggest you to take 3 minutes to shape the tree.

