Light up your festive spirits with the HOMCOM Small Christmas Tree! Pre-lit with 35 warm white LEDs and a convenient timer, it offers a cosy glow with zero fuss. Adorned with snow-flocked branches and pine cones, it captures a winter wonderland vibe. Safety is paramount with flame-retardant branches, ready to brighten your space securely. Great for adding a touch of Christmas charm to any small indoor area!
 Prelit design with timer ensures easy, stress-free lighting;
 64 snow-flocked tips and pine cones enhance a wintery festive atmosphere;
 Flame-retardant branches allow safe placement even near fireplaces;
 Round base wrapped in linen-look fabric combines stability with rustic charm;
 Battery operation offers cordless convenience for placement anywhere;
 Compact tabletop tree fits perfectly in small indoor spaces;
