products.sourceDescription:
Tired of the yearly Christmas setup stress and safety worries? The frustration of tangled branches and wobbly stands can steal precious family time. This season, create a serene and secure festive atmosphere with the HOMCOM full Spruce Christmas tree. Its tool-free assembly is effortless and the flame-retardant materials offer peace of mind. This Xmas tree brings the authentic beauty of a Nordic forest right into your living room, safely and simply.
 Realistic ponderosa fir shape;
 Boasts a denser look than others, making your decor stand out;
 Features moulded leaves for a realistic look while need little shaping;
 Hinged branches and a section design allow for quick, tool-free assembly;
 Crafted with flame-retardant materials to ensure a safe season;
 The foldable metal stand makes for stability and convenient off-season storage;
 Colour: Green
 Material: Plastic, Metal;
 Tree Type: Full Spruce;

 Tree Height: 5 ft;
 Tree Tip Count: 1375;
 Base Size: F40 cm;
 Suggest Shaping Time: 10-15 minutes;
 Item Label: 83C-087V00GN;

