products.sourceDescription:
Christmas made extra fun? Yes please. Do it, this season and beyond, with this Outsunny inflatable Christmas crystal ball, with Santa and a reindeer and Xmas tree inside, a world full of snow. The polyester shell makes this a tough piece, which is also IP44 rated for mild water resistance - it s suitable for use in mild rain outdoors. Inside there are five white LED lights - this blow up Christmas decoration glows and sparkles to bring the night alive, this season and beyond.
 - Fun design for Christmas: Santa Claus, reindeer and Xmas tree snow globe;
 - Inner white LED lights to glow at night;
 - Plug into the mains to inflate and set up. Turn off to deflate, with a bag for storage;
 - IP44 rated polyester shell is safe in mild rain. Suitable for outdoor use;
 - Four ground stakes and two guy ropes included to pin Xmas outdoor decoration to the ground;
 - Primary Colour: Red;
 - Type: Inflatable Crystal Ball Falling Snowflakes with Santa Claus, Reindeer and Xmas Tree;
 - Material: Polyester Cloth;
 - Overall Dimension: 120W x 120D x 170Hcm;
 - Overall Height: 5.5ft;
 - Cord Length: 3(m);
 - LED Light Count: 5;
 - LED Light Power: 0.5;
 - Fan: DC 12 V, 14.4 W, 1.2 A;
 - Input Voltage: AC 220-240 V, 50/60 Hz, 0.7 A;
 - Output Voltage: DC 12 V, 18 W, 1.5 A;
 - Certification: IP44;
 - Item Label: 844-961V70RD;
 NOTE: Blower needs to be plugged in to keep outdoor Christmas decoration full. Do not leave plugged in for more than eight hours. Do not use in heavy rain, snow or wind.

